meta {
  name: List TACOTS Students for Profile dropdown
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/lookup/tacots-students-profile
  body: none
  auth: none
}

vars:pre-request {
  baseUrl: http://localhost:3000
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # List TACOTS Students for Profile Dropdown

  Returns a lightweight list of TACOTS students who have been onboarded and have `SELECTED` admin status, for use in student profile dropdown/select components. Joins `tacots_onboarding` with `tacots_recommendation` (inner join on `SELECTED` status) and left joins `tacots_exit`. Each entry contains the student `id` (from `tacots_recommendation`), `name` (first name + surname), and `status`.

  ## Authorization
  No authentication required. This is a public lookup endpoint.

  ## Response

  **`200 OK`** — Returns an array of `{ id, name, status }` objects.

  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "students found successfully",
    "data": [
      { "id": "uuid", "name": "Jane Doe", "status": "SELECTED" }
    ],
    "meta": {
      "correlationId": "uuid-v4-string"
    }
  }
  ```

  | Field    | Type     | Description                                                        |
  |----------|----------|--------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | `id`     | `string` | The recommendation record UUID (used as student profile ID).       |
  | `name`   | `string` | Full name (first name + surname) from the recommendation record.   |
  | `status` | `string` | The admin status from the recommendation record (always SELECTED). |

  ## Caching
  Response is cached under `cedarrise:lookup:tacotsstudents` with `LISTS` TTL (10 mins).

  ## Errors

  | Status                      | Description              |
  |-----------------------------|--------------------------|
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error. |
}
